     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "Emploi",
     "md": "Le superlatif compare **un élément à tous les autres** (au moins trois) : Nkeng is **the tallest** boy in the class. On ajoute **in** + groupe (in the class, in Cameroon) ou **of** + nombre (of the three).\nMount Cameroon is **the highest** mountain in Cameroon."
